DOCX import: refreshing PAGEREF fields keeps the document unmodified

With PAGEREF fields, the DOCX import refreshes all fields on the
first OnFocus, which is still part of the load. The refresh marks
the SwDoc modified while the doc shell refuses the mark, so the two
disagree: the SwDoc says modified, the shell says not. The next
SetModified that the shell accepts, such as the line-number
charstyle made on the first paint of change bars, then reports the
untouched file as modified: it asks to save on close and keeps
writing recovery copies (Ely R15.13b). The import now restores the
SwDoc's state after its own refresh.
